WEBVTT

00:00:03.300 --> 00:00:07.093
Open Interaction Center, Management, Dispositions.

00:00:07.093 --> 00:00:08.990
Click Add Disposition.

00:00:13.951 --> 00:00:15.138
Enter a Name.

00:00:15.138 --> 00:00:16.825
Names must be unique.

00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:23.261
Add a Description, because a clear description helps agents, and the AI, tell the outcomes apart.

00:00:23.716 --> 00:00:28.414
Outcome stays None for a disposition that only people or the AI pick.

00:00:28.414 --> 00:00:30.857
Set lead status is for lead work:

00:00:30.857 --> 00:00:35.931
when an activity that belongs to a lead is completed with this disposition,

00:00:35.931 --> 00:00:38.186
the lead moves to that status.

00:00:38.642 --> 00:00:39.690
Click Save.

00:00:39.690 --> 00:00:43.203
A test-drive campaign might use three dispositions:

00:00:43.203 --> 00:00:46.902
Test Drive Booked, Call Back Later and Not Interested.

00:00:47.397 --> 00:00:52.264
The other two are created the same way, with a name and a description.

00:00:52.264 --> 00:00:57.067
The list then shows all three, each with an Edit and a Delete button.

